WEBVTT

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.450
New Himuka is deceiving us all!

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.290
You of all people must know this, Seto!

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.710
What are you talking about?!

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:28.550
I'm asking whether you're involved
in that horrific research!

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.260
Research?! I still don't know
what you're talking about!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.270
Gemma, the time for talking is long past.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.820
Huh? What's happening?

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:53.990
It seems we've no choice but to fight.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Whoa. I think I might sit this one out.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:08.130
Hey! Everyone, please calm down!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.090
You okay, Kasane?!

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:15.930
Yeah.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:18.140
What is going on?

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:21.190
We should all be on the same side.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.030
Nagi!

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:36.450
We did a lotta training
together, huh, Yuito?

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:40.410
And we almost missed
the induction ceremony together.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:44.370
Wanna go a round with me, Kasane?

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.880
Nagi...

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.400
<i>A crime in reality</i>

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.690
<i>For Heaven's sake</i>

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:09.610
<i>Accepts any fake</i>

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:12.030
<i>And disappears</i>

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:15.110
<i>Piling the eternity in fantasy</i>

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.660
<i>Won't take it at all</i>

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:17.740
<i>I get sick</i>

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.660
<i>A girl looking back</i>

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.080
<i>Casts the miracle</i>

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:25.040
<i>Into the instant world </i>

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.920
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.760
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.840
<i>Spit the venom </i>

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:39.600
<i>I know why</i>

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:43.180
<i>I've found a game of ecstasy</i>

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.810
<i>Red Criminal gets life</i>

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.270
<i>I've never been in love</i>

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:54.110
<i>Don't know when I started</i>
<i>getting sick of this world</i>

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.700
<i>We will fly</i>

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:58.530
<i>Someday I won't be crying</i>

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:03.370
<i>I've been sacrificing myself</i>

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.790
<i>Not to hurt anybody</i>

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:21.470
Red Strings

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:24.350
What's gotten into you, Nagi?

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.600
Are you in with Major General Karen, too?

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.520
Don't get the wrong idea, Kasane.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.650
I don't know what
the major general is planning,

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:36.860
but I'm not about to betray his trust!

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.630
Karen...

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.880
you never change.

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:54.000
You always keep me in the dark.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.670
You think I'm helpless?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:57.840
That's right.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:08.390
For a straight shooter
like you to do this,

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.020
it must've been tearing you up inside.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:18.490
I don't know what's gotten into you,

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:21.870
but is this really the path you choose?

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:27.450
I want to know the truth, nothing more!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.630
Damn it. What a sickening feeling

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.250
to have to fight your own comrades!

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.180
What's gotten into Nagi?!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:49.100
I've no idea. But he was acting strange
even before we got here.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:53.980
He seemed to think Naomi died in battle.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.360
What?

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.410
Nagi, you saw it with your own eyes.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:09.710
Do you really think Naomi died in battle?

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:13.630
Naomi... is dead.

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:16.460
Naomi...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.960
Naomi was turned into an Other.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.050
Guess I have no choice.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:26.050
I'll just have to eliminate you.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.250
Don't do this! Nagi!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.340
What the--?!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.970
Yuito! Kasane!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:24.950
Commander Seto.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.870
You both all right?

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:27.700
Yes, sir!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.240
Okay, then.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:34.830
Warning: Status Abnormal

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.870
His power is abnormally elevated.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:34.750
Nagi...

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.250
...what happened to you?

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:49.890
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.430
I won't let you.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:55.640
You'll regret it if you kill Yuito.

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:23.260
Enough!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.800
No.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.860
It's not over... yet.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:46.450
Not while I still draw breath.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:08:02.290
Nagi, you serve under me.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:06.260
I'll never let you switch sides.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.180
Nagi.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:19.440
Commander Seto.

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:28.030
Never let the Red Strings
escape your grasp.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:30.820
Huh?

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.570
Wataru, what's happening?

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:39.920
How should I know?!
I've never seen anything like this!

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:42.210
Kasane?! What's wrong?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.210
What the hell is this?

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.020
What is that?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.330
What the hell?!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.630
H-Help!

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:29.050
Yuito, run!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.970
Where'd he go?

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.520
It's too dangerous. Let's go.

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:44.020
Yuito! Kasane!

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.260
Help!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:20.270
Commander, help!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:22.390
Commander!

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:33.950
It's finally here.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:45.000
Seto!

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.880
Seto!

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:48.500
Gemma?!

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.760
You saved them, Colonel.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.730
Hang on tight!

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.650
Seto...

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:26.830
Seto... forgive me.

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:39.010
We're alive?

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:42.430
Normally, I'd be jumping for joy, but...

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.570
Where's Commander Seto?

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:55.610
He was swallowed up.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:59.070
Along with Yuito and Kasane, too?

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:25.350
What the--?

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:26.770
Kasane!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.790
You all right?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.830
Not really.

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:56.090
What is this place?

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:14.610
Who's that?

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.570
I'm not sure.

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:21.030
But that crest on his chest
is the Sumeragi family's.

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:25.830
And he looks just like Yakumo Sumeragi.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:58.360
I saw that in a dream.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.780
Kasane!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.790
Kasane!

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:16.210
Yuito! I'm so glad you came to.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:20.760
I was freaking out, thinking
that thing had swallowed you up.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.100
Where's Kasane?! And Nagi?!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.940
We don't know.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.570
No.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:41.400
There's nothing you can do.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:46.240
We wouldn't still be here
if Luka hadn't saved us.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.530
Luka?

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:52.750
He said he'd go find Major General Karen
and then ran off.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:01.710
Glad to see you're
still in one piece, Yuito.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:07.930
You're not on their side anymore, right?

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:13.020
It seems I've made a grave mistake.

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:14.440
Gemma!

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.730
"Emergency!"

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:26.910
Let's try this store once
they give the all-clear.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.200
Sounds good.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:32.620
Let's see. Their hours are...

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:33.450
Hmm?

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.330
Huh? What's going on?

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:36.790
Psynet's down?

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:38.170
No way.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:41.170
--What's the deal?
--The screen won't load.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.430
Good thing we had a shelter nearby.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.550
That should do it.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:53.310
You're like an old pro at this.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:58.480
I was kinda frail as a kid
and was always getting sick.

00:15:58.480 --> 00:16:01.480
And I patched myself up when I got hurt.

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:05.610
You're amazing.
I can't do anything like that.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:09.530
And my uncle is the director
general of the OSF Hospital.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:15.830
Here. Take these for your fever.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.580
Thanks.

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:23.090
I don't get it.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:26.420
How can you two talk to him
like nothing happened?

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.840
Tsugumi...

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.430
I can't forgive you, Gemma.
Not as things stand now.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:36.600
You're complicit in a battle that
claimed Commander Seto's life.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:40.650
Tsugumi's right.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:44.980
We need to know.
What in the world happened?

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:54.120
The New Himukan government aims to build
a surveillance society centered on Suoh.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.040
A surveillance society?

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:01.380
First, the government
conducts medical exams

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:06.170
with the intent of finding
the psionics users they need.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:10.760
Those scouted by the OSF
are unable to refuse.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:16.140
Once inducted, their growth is suppressed
to maintain their psionic powers.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:19.270
Everyone knows that.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:20.810
You're right.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:27.280
It's what must be done to defeat
the Others, and I've no issue with that.

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:31.110
However, it doesn't stop there.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:34.030
Ever heard of personality rehabilitation?

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.330
What?

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:41.540
I had a comrade who suddenly
started acting like a different person.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:47.000
He had always been a critic by nature,
so when he changed, everyone said,

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:50.590
"His personality
must've been manipulated."

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.510
That can't be...

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:55.800
You new recruits
probably never heard that,

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:59.180
but this sort of thing has
happened countless times.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:06.110
Personality rehabilitation
is an open secret among the OSF.

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:10.110
Tsugumi, you've at least
heard about it, haven't you?

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:17.700
Of course, it's all done under
the government's direction.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:21.160
The way Nagi was acting, or...

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.170
Don't tell me--

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:33.840
My actual age is 54.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:37.550
The effect of growth suppression
gradually wears off.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:42.480
Your body starts aging,
and your psionics slowly decline.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.810
I'll probably end up
having to leave the OSF.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:50.480
But before that day,
I wanted to know the truth.

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.990
That's when Karen told me

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:59.080
Seto was involved in research
on personality rehabilitation.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:03.620
Commander Seto wouldn't
do something like that.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.920
I know.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:08.540
Why didn't I believe him?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.670
I'm truly sorry.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:19.890
So then Major General Karen opposes
what the New Himukan government's doing?

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.060
No.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.940
It's finally here.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:34.320
There's more than meets the eye.
Karen most surely has...

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:38.740
"Warning!"

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.320
...another motive.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.680
Chief Sumeragi!

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:10.230
A large number of Others have
advanced into the heart of Suoh!

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.730
What?!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.690
Exterminate them at once!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.950
But the defense system is inoperable!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.990
Psynet is down!

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.160
And the council?

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:24.410
I don't know!
There's no way to contact them.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:29.420
Don't tell me Arahabaki has been...

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:39.340
Karen, why would you do this?

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:56.110
I <i>will </i>get it back this time.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.120
Kasane? Kasane!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.670
Kasane.

00:21:21.890 --> 00:21:24.600
Was that just a dream?

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:27.980
Kasane, are you okay?

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.480
Yeah.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:34.480
Where are we?

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:37.530
Kasane, take a look at that.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:50.290
That's the Kunad Highway. What happened?

00:21:52.170 --> 00:21:57.920
We've no idea.
It was like this when we came to.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:20.070
Time's a-wasting,

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:22.070
Kasane.

00:24:09.170 --> 00:24:11.930
Karen's Revolt
